    <briefdescription>
<para>Tuning for an <ref refid="classOpenSkyhawk_1_1AngleSensorInput" kindref="compound">AngleSensorInput</ref> — the <ref refid="structOpenSkyhawk_1_1AnalogConfig" kindref="compound">AnalogConfig</ref> fields that still mean something once the raw window comes from the centre and travel (#295). Set by name: <computeroutput>{ .hysteresis = 512 }</computeroutput>. Fields are only ever appended, each with a default. </para>
    </briefdescription>
